  "title": "Vietnamese Chicken and Long-Grain Rice Congee",
  "description": "Congee is a hearty porridge made with rice and broth--a much overlooked soup, and a comfort food of a lot of Asian people. This recipe is flavorful, light, and goes down real easy when you are feeling a little out of the weather.",
